WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:04,470
When you go out, stop talking nonsense and wait until I come back, Xiao Chen

2
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:05,870
Why didn't you say anything when you came?

3
00:00:05,870 --> 00:00:07,710
It's good that everything is over

4
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:10,070
I don't want you to worry about me causing trouble.

5
00:00:10,190 --> 00:00:11,270
we have been waiting for you

6
00:00:11,390 --> 00:00:13,350
Don’t be moved by your hypocrisy

7
00:00:13,630 --> 00:00:23,780
Stand up with this attitude when elders talk to you. Elders, you are all qualified. Sister, get up. This is Grandpa. Shut up.

8
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:24,820
You have no place to speak here

9
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:26,180
This is real gold

10
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:30,930
Don't take it lightly. Okay, everyone, sit down. You should sit down too.

11
00:00:31,170 --> 00:00:33,170
How to behave like a boss when facing a leader?

12
00:00:33,370 --> 00:00:35,250
You are that girl from the Su family

13
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:36,530
I have nothing to do with the Su family

14
00:00:36,530 --> 00:00:37,850
The Su family can recognize you

15
00:00:38,010 --> 00:00:39,050
You are the same as Ling Yun

16
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:40,170
They are all granddaughters of the Su family

17
00:00:40,170 --> 00:00:42,290
Two jade talismans have paid off the debt of gratitude

18
00:00:42,490 --> 00:00:44,530
I don’t have the hobby of rushing to be someone’s grandson.

19
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:46,760
Everyone is here today

20
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:47,760
I say it one last time

21
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:51,960
I'm not interested in either the Su family or the Lu family. Stop harassing me and go their separate ways.

22
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:53,720
I don’t want to end up like the Huo family

23
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:54,680
Just stay away from me
